During the 5-Fold Cross Validation phase, the ensemble demonstrated an average Training F1-Score of 99.65\% ($\pm$0.12\%) and a Validation F1-Score of 96.60\% ($\pm$0.36\%). The resulting Variance Drop of 3.05\% indicates that the architecture generalized well to unseen structural routing rather than artificially memorizing the dataset.

