\subsection{Architectural Ablation: The Semantic Paradox}
To rigorously quantify the contribution of each modality within the 899-D structure, an architectural ablation study was conducted (Table \ref{tab:ablation}). To accurately simulate edge-deployment environments and eradicate temporal data leakage, this ablation study was executed directly against the isolated Zero-Day Holdout Vault rather than relying on cross-validation sets.

